description=Throttles like the stock ROM when the battery gets hot (sun, mount, charging): 40 C caps the fast CPU cores and GPU a little, 42 C more plus slower charging, 45 C strongest caps and charging held back. Lifts them when it cools. Checks one file every 15 s.
